From: Ning <hwn123123@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] adapt data addressing and asynchronous radio state

Preserve real IPv4 addressing and network-port types. Serialize late slot
exports and refresh SIM properties after insertion. Recompute modem state
after interface initialization, report SIM property changes and implement
the Simple.Connect enable step with a bounded registration timeout.
Keep power operations synchronized with oFono instead of emitting a
synthetic enabled state. NetworkManager owns reconnection policy; a bearer
disconnect does not trigger an independent background reconnect.

